OL,3,GNEWSAMosaic fragment 'thought lost' to
OL,4,Ago on display
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was reburied in the 19th Century but
OL,7,Fyears of building construction meant it
OL,8,Fsuffered damage. A surviving section
OL,9,Fwas lifted by specialists and looked
OL,10,Fafter by the Lamplough's of Gloucester
OL,11,FHouse.
